@thienan496 I now think there's no better solution. Consider two (possibly adaptive) policies T and F which you'd follow if the answer is true or false respectively.
Their returns R(T) and R(F) are each ~Bin(100, 0.5) over all possible sequences
What we care about is E[max(R(T),R(F))].

